<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BayerVB, Deutsche Bank, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and LB Hessen-Thuringen.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    01.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   *25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		 *PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.175</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
